      "text": "Wault Finance's WUSD stablecoin mechanism on BNB Chain was exploited on August 4, 2021, resulting in losses around $930,000. The attacker engineered flash-loan cycles to manipulate WEX token prices and drain protocol reserves. The WUSD stablecoin's reserve logic automatically bought WEX during minting and allowed immediate redemption. This enabled atomic pump-and-dump cycles in a single transaction, letting an attacker manipulate the WEX price and extract excess value."
